⍝ Tests for the ]Docs user command's install logic, run by test_docs_ucmd.py.
⍝ Environment: DOCS_UCMD (Docs.dyalog), DOCS_ARCHIVE (with .sha256 beside it),
⍝ DOCS_TAMPERED (a .sha256 beside it that matches neither it nor DOCS_ARCHIVE),
⍝ DOCS_ROOT (empty dir).
⍝ Prints one PASS/FAIL line per check; exits 1 on any failure.

Env←{2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment'⍵}
docs←⎕SE.⎕FIX'file://',Env'DOCS_UCMD'
archive←Env'DOCS_ARCHIVE'
tampered←Env'DOCS_TAMPERED'
root←Env'DOCS_ROOT'
fails←0
Check←{⎕←(⊃'FAIL ' 'PASS '⌷⍨1+⍵),⍺ ⋄ fails+←~⍵ ⋄ ⍬}
Opts←{⍺←'' ⋄ o←⎕NS ⍬ ⋄ o.(version root system from baseurl)←'21.0'⍵ 0 ⍺ '' ⋄ o}
Text←{∊⍵,¨⎕UCS 10}
Leftovers←{⊃⎕NINFO⍠1⊢⍵,'/.*'}
Sha←{(⊃⎕NGET ⍵,'.sha256')↑⍨64}
Bytes←{t←⍵ ⎕NTIE 0 ⋄ b←⎕NREAD t 83 ¯1 0 ⋄ b⊣⎕NUNTIE t}  ⍝ raw: ⎕NGET normalises line endings

dest←root,'/21.0'
r←docs.Install archive Opts root
'fresh install creates index.html'Check ⎕NEXISTS dest,'/index.html'
meta←⎕JSON⊃⎕NGET dest,'/bundle.json'
'bundle.json records the archive sha256'Check meta.sha256≡Sha archive
'bundle.json has no CR line separators'Check~13∊Bytes dest,'/bundle.json'
'result names the DYALOGHELPDIR value'Check∨/('DYALOGHELPDIR=file://',dest)⍷Text r

stamp←3 ⎕NINFO dest,'/index.html'
r←docs.Install archive Opts root
'second run reports up to date'Check∨/'up to date'⍷Text r
'second run leaves the install untouched'Check stamp≡3 ⎕NINFO dest,'/index.html'

(⊂'previous')⎕NPUT dest,'/f.txt'
ok←0
:Trap 11 22
    {}docs.Install tampered Opts root
:Else
    ok←∨/'checksum'⍷⎕DMX.Message
:EndTrap
'tampered archive is refused with a checksum error'Check ok
'previous install intact after refused update'Check ⎕NEXISTS dest,'/f.txt'
'no temporary directories left behind'Check 0=≢Leftovers root

spaced←root,'/Application Support/Dyalog/docs'
r←docs.Install archive Opts spaced
'root with spaces works'Check ⎕NEXISTS spaced,'/21.0/index.html'

lone←root,'/lone.tar.gz'
lone ⎕NCOPY archive
ok←0
:Trap 22
    {}docs.Install lone Opts root,'/other'
:Else
    ok←∨/'.sha256'⍷⎕DMX.Message
:EndTrap
'archive without a .sha256 beside it is refused'Check ok

s←docs.Status Opts root
'status reports version and build date'Check∧/∨/¨('21.0' '2026-11-27')⍷¨⊂Text s

⎕OFF fails>0
